    "name": "Serrano pepper",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Serrano peppers are&nbsp;small, slender, chili peppers, typically 1-4 inches long, with a conical shape that tapers to a rounded point.&nbsp;They are known for their bright, crisp flavor and moderate to hot spiciness.&nbsp;While commonly green, they can also mature to red, brown, orange, or yellow, with red varieties often being slightly sweeter.&nbsp;</span></p>",
